## HARD gotchas (do not rediscover)

- **The author redeploys the Hub, not me.** A local build changes nothing — ask, wait, verify the
  new build serves (compare `C:\Apps\MindAttic\Prose\Hub.exe` mtime to the running PID's start).
- **`prose.cmd` + a heredoc in one Bash call DEADLOCKS.** Always `< /dev/null`.
- **Every book-touching method must `SetFlowUniverse` first** — an unscoped beat save strips every
  entity tag from the prose.
- **All JS interop through `JsAsync<T>`/`JsVoidAsync`** — an unhandled `JSException` tears down the
  Blazor circuit and the window silently freezes.
- **`min-height` does not apply to non-replaced inline boxes** — `.mini` on an `<a>` was 16px.
- **Do not add anything to `SystemVersionedTables`** — log tables are excluded by policy.
- The 5 failing tests are pre-existing (`WorldState*`, `Snapshot*`). Verified at HEAD. Leave them.
